{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e2af13d7da794d50bf4142c08486240e/snapshots/106e695c35d04626bef6054064594a9b-00001.jpg\"/><p>十月，正值山西蘆芽山秋色最迷人之時。色彩斑斕的樹葉、常綠的森林與起伏山巒相互交織，構成一幅生動的全景圖。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8503217_山西蘆芽山 秋色層林盡染 done - 截图4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e2af13d7da794d50bf4142c08486240e/snapshots/106e695c35d04626bef6054064594a9b-00004.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>紅楓金楊映深綠雲杉　十月秋色最迷人</strong></p><p></p><p>位於忻州市寧武縣的蘆芽山，以森林山坡、高山草甸和壯麗山景聞名，獨特景觀吸引山西及中國其他地區遊客，尤其夏季和秋季旅遊旺季。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8503217_山西蘆芽山 秋色層林盡染 done - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e2af13d7da794d50bf4142c08486240e/snapshots/106e695c35d04626bef6054064594a9b-00006.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>每逢秋天，紅色楓葉與金黃楊樹在深綠雲杉襯托下格外突出，飄動的雲霧穿梭山峰之間。從山坡全景到秋葉特寫，蘆芽山展現華北季節之美。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:40:37.886265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:16.276782+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:38:18.490066+00:00","content_hash":"5cca440c543e094a75f45bf5924a75a11a4fbf93b1eacbb7723f0c53b16132f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}